// TestAccFileResource_ImportSyncsLocal tests the import_syncs_local feature.
// When enabled with an empty source_hash (fresh import), the provider downloads
// the remote file content to the local source path during the post-import apply.
//
// The workflow is:
// 1. Create a remote file manually (simulating a pre-existing file)
// 2. Apply config with import_syncs_local=true (no local file exists)
