          "content": "## Docker Container Update Checker\n\nChecks all homelab LXCs for Docker image updates.\n\n**Features:**\n- Docker Hub, GHCR, LinuxServer.io\n- Semver comparison (ignores distro variants)\n- Filters pre-releases by default\n- Uses ntfy template for formatting\n\n**Requires:** `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_EXTERNAL=node-fetch`",
